<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $1.00 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $1.00 higher. Demand moderate. Top $57.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs.  55.50-57.00, few 57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3 230-260 lbs.  54.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady, instances 1.00 higher. Top 52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 43.00-46.00</p>
<p>	 400-500 lbs. 45.00-48.00</p>
<p>	 500-600 lbs. 47.00-49.00, few 50.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 49.00-50.00, few 51.00-52.00</p>
</text>
